17
00:01:45,360 --> 00:01:46,320
Anyone is fine.

18
00:01:46,720 --> 00:01:49,580
Every instructor at our base
is very professional.

19
00:01:50,880 --> 00:01:53,840
Then I'll go find my instructor
to book a class now.

20
00:02:06,600 --> 00:02:07,720
The sealing ring is replaced.

21
00:02:07,720 --> 00:02:09,320
The pipe won't leak anymore.

22
00:02:15,320 --> 00:02:17,050
Hello, I'd like to book a class.

23
00:02:33,560 --> 00:02:35,560
Everything is going smoothly here.

24
00:02:35,920 --> 00:02:37,280
I eat and sleep well.

25
00:02:37,520 --> 00:02:39,720
I'll invite you guys over when I'm free.

26
00:02:44,280 --> 00:02:45,240
Manager Yun,

27
00:02:45,640 --> 00:02:47,640
