It was just an accident.

49
00:03:41,320 --> 00:03:42,920
If you like this type...

50
00:03:43,120 --> 00:03:44,440
I have some collections here.

51
00:03:44,440 --> 00:03:46,100
Want me to share them with you?

52
00:03:48,280 --> 00:03:52,120
Don't you think it's a bit shameful?

53
00:03:52,120 --> 00:03:53,760
What's so shameful about it?

54
00:03:53,920 --> 00:03:56,720
If they dare to post it,
we can just watch it openly.

55
00:03:57,600 --> 00:04:00,520
You wouldn't stalk them

56
00:04:00,520 --> 00:04:02,760
