with watching them, right?

57
00:04:02,760 --> 00:04:03,620
No, I wouldn't.

58
00:04:04,000 --> 00:04:06,760
I just admire them through the internet.

59
00:04:06,920 --> 00:04:07,960
That's fine then.

60
00:04:08,000 --> 00:04:09,920
Don't suppress your feelings.

61
00:04:10,200 --> 00:04:12,840
Even animals follow their instincts.

62
00:04:13,000 --> 00:04:13,760
Only humans

63
