mix so many

64
00:04:15,400 --> 00:04:17,130
complicated things into love.

65
00:04:17,279 --> 00:04:19,640
You're physically attracted to this type.

66
00:04:19,640 --> 00:04:21,640
So just face yourself, accept yourself,

67
00:04:21,640 --> 00:04:22,970
and liberate yourself.

68
00:04:24,240 --> 00:04:25,240
Liberate myself.

69
00:04:28,160 --> 00:04:28,960
Shout with me,

70
00:04:29,960 --> 00:04:31,800
